<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trinova Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trinova Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>--- NatWest Securities said it downgraded Trinova Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited Trinova's lower-than-expected fourth quarter earnings results. Trinova posted earnings of $0.85 a share compared with $0.68 a share.</p>
<p>-- said the 12-month price target remains $45 a share.</p>
<p>-- Trinova gained 7/8 to 40-1/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
